      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="nav-logo" style="margin-bottom:1rem">
          <span class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning"></i></span>
          <span class="logo-text">Mod<span class="logo-accent">Vault</span></span>
        </div>
        <p>The best source for premium MOD APKs. All files are scanned and tested before publishing.</p>
        <div class="footer-social">
          <a href="#" aria-label="Telegram"><i class="fa-brands fa-telegram"></i></a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="YouTube"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links-group">
        <h4>Navigation</h4>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/games">Games</a>
        <a href="/apps">Apps</a>
        <a href="/categories">Categories</a>
        <a href="/latest">Latest</a>
        <a href="/search">Search</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links-group">
